Proof-Route Tournament
----------------------
Vertices: proof routes/carriers, not integers or conjectures.
Observable: majority over predicate retention, computability, cross-problem transfer, proof strength, and lower risk.
Switch/gauge: A -> B when A wins the majority of criteria.
Tie Hamiltonian path: route score descending.
